  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7002.02 “Bingo event” means a gathering at which a series of no fewer than 10 successive bingo games is held within a single day.\n\nSource. #13067, eff 6-26-20; ss by #14138, eff 11-27-24, EXPIRES: 11-27-34",
